    "id": "IM-001",
    "category": "pattern",
    "content": "Dating platform ToS requires special attention to: (1) Auto-renewal point-of-sale disclosure beyond ToS text (CA ARL, FTC), (2) No-background-checks disclaimer at multiple UI touchpoints, (3) GDPR Art. 9 explicit consent for sensitive data (sexual orientation), (4) Biometric data provisions if facial recognition used (BIPA), (5) PAGA carve-out in arbitration if CA employees, (6) Section 230 safe harbor with CSAM reporting obligations. Evaluator gate on haiku had MCP tool access limitations - use sonnet for evaluator or provide findings directly in prompt.",
