    "id": "IM-mmdhpydw-6jop",
    "category": "pattern",
    "content": "FTC 2024 click-to-cancel rule: subscription cancellation must be as easy as sign-up. Combined with California ARL and EU withdrawal rights, auto-renewal sections need jurisdiction-specific treatment. Always check for: (1) pre-purchase disclosure, (2) affirmative consent, (3) easy cancellation, (4) pre-renewal reminder.",
