  {
    "id": "IM-mmdrazdd-kl71",
    "category": "pattern",
    "content": "GDPR privacy policy for EU SaaS startups: Key structure is 16 sections covering Art. 13/14 disclosures. Must include purpose-legal basis table, named sub-processor table with transfer safeguards, per-category retention periods. Spanish specifics: LOPDGDD Art. 7 age of consent at 14, AEPD (C/ Jorge Juan 6, 28001 Madrid), LSSI Art. 22 for cookies, Ley General Tributaria Art. 66 for 4-year tax retention. Common RED findings: undefined marketing legal basis, vague retention, missing cookie consent, unsigned DPAs, undocumented transfer safeguards.",
